; Room 28 ($1C): First Landing
;
; Format: see #R$C000.
; .
; Border: magenta (3). Conveyor: none. Ramp: 15 cells from row 14 column 9 up
; to row 0 column 23, rising to the right.
; .
; Items (from the item table at #R$A400): 1, at row 3 column 26. The item
; graphic of this room is all zeros, so the item cells show nothing but their
; colour (inferred from #R$93D1, not run).
; .
; Exits: left Room 29 (The Nightmare Room, #R$DD00); right Room 27 (The
; Chapel, #R$DB00); up Room 34 (Top Landing, #R$E200); down Room 22 (To the
; Kitchens    Main Stairway, #R$D600).
; .
; Entities: slot 0: definition $43 (at $A218) start $19. List ends at slot 1
; ($FF).
@label=RoomFirstLanding
b$DC00 DEFB $A0,$00,$00,$00,$00,$00,$A0,$00 ; row 0: ##......................##......
 $DC08 DEFB $A0,$00,$00,$00,$00,$00,$A0,$00 ; row 1: ##......................##......
 $DC10 DEFB $A0,$00,$00,$00,$00,$00,$A0,$00 ; row 2: ##......................##......
 $DC18 DEFB $A0,$00,$00,$00,$00,$00,$A0,$30 ; row 3: ##......................##...*..
 $DC20 DEFB $A0,$00,$00,$00,$00,$00,$A0,$FC ; row 4: ##......................##..***.
 $DC28 DEFB $A0,$00,$00,$00,$00,$00,$A0,$30 ; row 5: ##......................##...*..
